* 3D: top die shifted +4 in x and lifted 0.0005, so its boundary edge lies exactly over the brick nodes at x=4. Exercises the inside code (FUN_1404d3e13, natural-coordinate band 0.001) and edge/vertex sign logic. Predict: nodes x>=4 on top get -1, nodes at x=0 do not
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 4 0 0.0005
INICTC 2
GENCTC 0.001
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
